[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0001","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0010","text":"……本来，猫是狩猎的动物\n大口吃肉才是它们自然的样子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0020","text":"这款猫粮使用了绿色牛肚……\n也就是100%的内脏————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0030","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0040","text":"哎呀，有虫子……在飞呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0050","text":"失礼了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0060","text":"这是为了让您家中重要的猫咪\n能够长寿而开发出的食品————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0062","text":"工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0070","text":"——现在把猫粮放进碗里哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0080","text":"…………\n生命的…………重量…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0090","text":"CM，第一个镜头，\n拿着猫粮微笑的感觉！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0091","text":"导演"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0100","text":"那么，正式开拍！\n————第1条！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_30800400_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
